timeline
    title The development of the simulator
    section September 2026
        From 25 Sep (est.) : Architecture of the simulator, the Engine, and gVirtualXRay
    section October 2026
        11 to 15 Oct : One repository with the Engine and gVirtualXRay as submodules : Build system, presets, and CI : The core library of gVirtualXRay in the build : The first X-ray image, beside the scene drawn by the Engine
        19 to 21 Oct : The controls of the X-ray setup : The check of the submodule pins
        24 to 29 Oct : Timers of the image : A detector that is cheap to create : A vcpkg cache that restores
