        5 to 11 Nov : Troubleshooting : C++23, and the X-ray part with MSVC : The adapter on the Engine's context, kept alive : Picking, materials, moving the objects : A free X-ray tube
        12 to 17 Nov : An orbit camera, the view in decimetres : The tube, the detector, and the beam in the 3D view : The image seen from the source
        21 to 23 Nov : Shared GLEW and the standard triplets : The detector resized in place
        24 to 25 Nov : Build instructions, the diagram tool : The diagrams and charts : README badges and captures : A start view from the command line
    section Planned
